 Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_pea_in_a_haystack.\" title=\"A pea in a haystack.\">A pea in a haystack.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_dong_and_the_gong.\" title=\"The dong and the gong.\">The dong and the gong.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Little polythene grief cave.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_very_nuanced_character.\" title=\"A very nuanced character.\">A very nuanced character.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_F.I.P.\" title=\"The F.I.P.\">The F.I.P.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Little polythene grief cave.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2c/Little_polythene_grief_cave..png/revision/latest?cb=20210120072538\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Little polythene grief cave.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2c/Little_polythene_grief_cave..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210120072538\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2c/Little_polythene_grief_cave..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210120072538 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2c/Little_polythene_grief_cave..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210120072538 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Little polythene grief cave.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Little_polythene_grief_cave..png\" data-image-name=\"Little polythene grief cave..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_3\" title=\"Series 3\">3</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paul_Chowdhry\" title=\"Paul Chowdhry\">Paul Chowdhry</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_dong_and_the_gong.\" title=\"The dong and the gong.\">The dong and the gong.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_very_nuanced_character.\" title=\"A very nuanced character.\">A very nuanced character.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Little polythene grief cave.</b></i> is the third episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_3\" title=\"Series 3\">Series 3</a> of <i>Taskmaster</i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 18 October 2016. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Paul_Chowdhry\" title=\"Paul Chowdhry\">Paul Chowdhry</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Little_polythene_grief_cave.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Little polythene grief cave\" was how <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> described the improvised sweat lodge constructed by <a href=\"/wiki/Dave_Gorman\" title=\"Dave Gorman\">Dave Gorman</a> during the <a href=\"/wiki/Fill_this_egg_cup_with_your_own_sweat\" title=\"Fill this egg cup with your own sweat\">Fill this egg cup with your own sweat</a> task, while the title card is a domino from the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_domino_rally\" title=\"Make the best domino rally\">Make the best domino rally</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Little_polythene_grief_cave.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En lille \"sorg-hule\" af plastic', which translates as 'A little \"sorrow cave\" made of plastic'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Pieni polyeteeninen suruluola', which translates as 'Little polythene grief cave'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Liten sorghule av polyeten', which translates as 'Little polythene grief cave'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Little_polythene_grief_cave.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Al_Murray\" title=\"Al Murray\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Al Murray</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Dave_Gorman\" title=\"Dave Gorman\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Dave Gorman</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Paul_Chowdhry\" title=\"Paul Chowdhry\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Paul Chowdhry</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rob_Beckett\" title=\"Rob Beckett\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rob Beckett</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sara_Pascoe\" title=\"Sara Pascoe\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sara Pascoe</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_battery-operated_item\" title=\"Best battery-operated item\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best battery-operated item.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fill_this_egg_cup_with_your_own_sweat\" title=\"Fill this egg cup with your own sweat\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Fill this egg cup with your own sweat.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> You must complete the whole task speaking in an accent different to your own for 20 minutes.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>–</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>–</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>-</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>–</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_domino_rally\" title=\"Make the best domino rally\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the best domino rally.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Buy_a_gift_for_the_Taskmaster\" title=\"Buy a gift for the Taskmaster\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Buy a gift for the Taskmaster.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Create_the_best_flag_meal\" title=\"Create the best flag meal\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td>Create the best flag meal.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</